::::: {.hero-code}
```r
library(ggseg)
library(ggplot2)

ggplot() +
  geom_brain(
    atlas = dk(),
    aes(fill = region),
    position = position_brain(hemi ~ view),
    show.legend = FALSE
  ) +
  theme_void()
```
